WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,740 --> 00:00:03,940
But Ling Yang is so smart

2
00:00:04,220 --> 00:00:16,430
Keeping it is always a disaster, Brother Chen

3
00:00:16,430 --> 00:00:18,360
What happened?

4
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:26,160
Find out who the great man is

5
00:00:28,370 --> 00:00:29,650
From coming back to now

6
00:00:29,890 --> 00:00:32,780
I have never checked Ling Ge. I trust him.

7
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:36,430
He has brought us alive until now

8
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:37,950
I don't want to doubt him

9
00:00:38,670 --> 00:00:40,150
But he's so spooky these days

10
00:00:40,670 --> 00:00:41,910
Asked him to live with me but he refused

11
00:00:42,030 --> 00:00:43,310
Ask him to fetch water but he won't go

12
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:45,430
Even if you ask him to look for food together, he won't go.

13
00:00:45,870 --> 00:00:46,950
So I looked him up

14
00:00:46,950 --> 00:00:51,530
he is a great man
